window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>New rule: When you find a shiny, pretty necklace, do </b><b><i>not</i></b><b> put it on.</b></p> <p>Jas has long known about magical objects. She just never thought the pendant her summer fling left behind would be one. </p> <p>Now Jas has to figure out how to master her pendant...before it masters her. </p> <p><i>*Jas will take you on a wild ride filled with loads of magic, sizzling adventure, sexy shifters and fae, and enough spunk to leave you wanting more. </i> </p> <p><i>*</i>Power Pendant<i> is best heard as book 5 of the Magical Creatures Academy. However, Jas’ trilogy can also be heard as a standalone series. </i> </p> <p><i>*Jas embraces her wild side. This series is recommended for ages 16 and up due to language and sexual situations.</i></p>"; 
